---
title: Garam masala
servings: 12
tags: [basics, spice mix, indian]
source: https://github.com/LiHRaM/cooklang-recipes
---

Stir together @ground cumin{1%tbsp}, @ground coriander{1.5%tsp}, @cardamom{1.5%tsp}, @black pepper{1.5%tsp}, @ground cinnamon{1%tsp}, @ground cloves{1/2%tsp} and @ground nutmeg{1/2%tsp} in a #small bowl{}.

Keep in an airtight jar somewhere cool and dark.
